From: Ada <ada@6bit.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:11:21 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] P13: the Agents panel shows the resident, read-only
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The human's own harness accounts are unchanged; a tile from omanix.status
shows the resident's state and opens its chat (DESIGN §f.2.5 P13).
---
 shell/plugins/agents/Panel.qml | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/shell/plugins/agents/Panel.qml b/shell/plugins/agents/Panel.qml
index 33a0627..f84e5b0 100644
--- a/shell/plugins/agents/Panel.qml
+++ b/shell/plugins/agents/Panel.qml
@@ -1094,6 +1094,14 @@ Panel {
             }
           }
 
+          // omanix (P13): the resident's state, read-only (omanix.status).
+          Loader {
+            width: column.width
+            active: root.addStage === ""
+            source: Util.fileUrl(Quickshell.env("OMARCHY_PATH") + "/shell/plugins/omanix-status/ResidentTile.qml")
+            onLoaded: { item.shell = root.bar ? root.bar.shell : null; item.foreground = root.foreground }
+          }
+
           AddView {
             visible: root.addStage !== "" || root.blankSlate
             width: column.width
